From: Tom Care <tcare@meta.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Sep 2025 16:52:20 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] vsock: aggressively drain guest tx buffer

Summary:
Aggressively drain the guest -> host TX buffer, mitigating the flood of buffer fills when VSCode RL extention calls dumpsys display.

Real fix is to have a thread per buffer, but that is more involved and this will do for now.

Test Plan: ADB does not go down after 1min

Rollback Plan:

Reviewers: olja, achong

Reviewed By: olja

Subscribers: <internal-group>

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.intern.facebook.com/D82502239

Tags: autoknowledge_diff_eligible
